              ":answer/value": "\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2}\\bigl[(- \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(\\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\\\&\\quad+(- \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + 2)(- \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "0bf1b213-25bf-5187-a3a7-c00a753f47c0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2}\\bigl[(- \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})(\\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\\\&\\quad+(- \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + 2)(- \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}"
            },
