    "question": {
      ":question/id": "d6d4b501-2b4c-5853-9ba6-5ee8131ed3c8",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which ordinary definite integral represents $\\int_C \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{r}$ given that $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(- 2 y^{2})\\,\\mathbf{i}+(- x^{2})\\,\\mathbf{j}$ and $C$ is the path $\\mathbf{r}(t)=(t^{2})\\,\\mathbf{i}+(t)\\,\\mathbf{j}$ for $t\\in [0,1]$?\n\nUse the supplied parameterization and limits. Select the integral whose integrand is $\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)$; do not evaluate it.\n\n*Hint: $\\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)=(2 t)\\,\\mathbf{i}+(1)\\,\\mathbf{j}$. Substitute both coordinates into the field, then take the dot product.*",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the vector line-integral formula:\n\n$$\n\\int_C \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{r}=\\int_a^b \\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\n$$\n\nSubstitute the coordinates $x=t^{2}$ and $y=t$ into both field components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))&=(- 2 (t)^{2})\\,\\mathbf{i}\\\\&\\quad+(- (t^{2})^{2})\\,\\mathbf{j}\\\\&=(- 2 t^{2})\\,\\mathbf{i}\\\\&\\quad+(- t^{4})\\,\\mathbf{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiate each path component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x^{\\prime}(t)&=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t^{2})=2 t,\\\\y^{\\prime}(t)&=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t)=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiply matching components and add:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)\\\\&=(- 2 t^{2})(2 t)\\\\&\\quad+(- t^{4})(1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplify the products:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)=- t^{4} - 4 t^{3}.\n$$\n\nKeep the supplied parameter limits. The required integral is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1}\\bigl[(- 2 t^{2})(2 t)\\\\&\\quad+(- t^{4})(1)\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "d29859bf-e75e-5da8-a161-6f6c53ac17b4",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "cec4a9c2-7d13-54ad-9f80-42076f36a879",
